SELECT (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(id), 0) + 1 FROM subtitles), e.id, 0, 0.0, 11.519, '[applause] guys you know it''s i can''t believe how fast 20 years went by me this is crazy this is absolutely crazy', '[掌声] 伙计们，你们好。 我知道自己做不到。 简直不敢相信，20 年就这么过去了。真是不可思议啊。', '/əˈplɔz ɡaɪz ju noʊ ɪts aɪ kænt bɪˈliv haʊ fæst ˈtwɛnti jɪrz wɛnt baɪ mi ðɪs ɪz ˈkreɪzi ðɪs ɪz ˈæbsəˌlutli ˈkreɪzi/', '<span>[applause]</span> <span>guys</span> <span>you</span> <span>know</span> <span>it''s</span> <span>i</span> <span>can''t</span> <span>believe</span> <span>how</span> <span>fast</span> <span>20</span> <span>years</span> <span>went</span> <span>by</span> <span>me</span> <span>this</span> <span>is</span> <span>crazy</span> <span>this</span> <span>is</span> <span>absolutely</span> <span>crazy</span>'
