SELECT (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(id), 0) + 1 FROM subtitles), e.id, 6, 55.969, 65.4, 'and i''m more proud i''m more proud of the fact that not about the championships for it about the down years', '还有 我更自豪的是……/我尤其引以为傲的是…… 这与冠军无关，而是关乎那些表现不佳的年份。', '/ænd aɪm mɔr praʊd aɪm mɔr praʊd əv ðə fækt ðæt nɑt əˈbaʊt ðə ˈtʃæmpiənʃɪps fɔr ɪt əˈbaʊt ðə daʊn jɪrz/', '<span>and</span> <span>i''m</span> <span>more</span> <span>proud</span> <span>i''m</span> <span>more</span> <span>proud</span> <span>of</span> <span>the</span> <span>fact</span> <span>that</span> <span>not</span> <span>about</span> <span>the</span> <span>championships</span> <span>for</span> <span>it</span> <span>about</span> <span>the</span> <span>down</span> <span>years</span>'
